      <description sparkle:format="markdown">## 更新内容

- 影片和剧集详情新增多来源评论，并按时间展示，方便了解其他观众的看法。
- 优化剧集评论匹配及评论窗口的初始滚动位置。

需要 macOS 12.0 或更高版本。请按 Mac 芯片选择 Apple Silicon 或 Intel 安装包。

## What’s New

- Added reviews from multiple sources to movie and series details, ordered by date.
- Improved series review matching and the initial scroll position of the reviews window.

Requires macOS 12.0 or later. Choose the Apple Silicon or Intel download for your Mac.
